#. module: stock_barcodes_picking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_barcodes_picking.field_stock_picking_type__barcode_require_pack
msgid ""
"If 'After Each Product', a package is mandatory after each product is "
"scanned. If 'After a Group of Products', packages are optional but all "
"products must be packed before validation."
msgstr ""
"若选择\"每个产品之后\"，扫描每个产品后必须装包。"
"若选择\"一组产品之后\"，装包可选但所有产品必须在验证前装包。"

#. module: stock_barcodes_picking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_barcodes_picking.field_stock_picking_type__barcode_validation_all_packed
msgid ""
"If enabled, all picked products must be put into a package before the "
"transfer can be validated. (Requires 'After a Group of Products' or 'After "
"Each Product'.)"
msgstr ""
"若启用，所有已拣产品必须在验证调拨单前装入包裹。"
"（需要已选择\"一组产品之后\"或\"每个产品之后\"。）"

#. module: stock_barcodes_picking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_barcodes_picking.field_stock_picking_type__barcode_show_reserved_sns
msgid ""
"If enabled, reserved (but not yet picked) serial numbers are displayed in "
"the barcode scanner so the picker knows which serial numbers to scan."
msgstr ""
"若启用，已预留（尚未拣选）的序列号将显示在条码扫描器中，"
"便于拣货员知道需要扫描哪些序列号。"

#. module: stock_barcodes_picking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_barcodes_picking.field_stock_picking_type__barcode_scan_dest_location
msgid ""
"If enabled, the barcode scan flow requires the operator to scan the "
"destination location barcode. If disabled, the picking's default destination"
" location is used automatically."
msgstr ""
"若启用，条码扫描流程要求操作员扫描目的库位条码。"
"若禁用，则自动使用调拨单的默认目的库位。"

#. module: stock_barcodes_picking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_barcodes_picking.field_stock_picking_type__barcode_scan_source_location
msgid ""
"If enabled, the barcode scan flow requires the operator to scan the source "
"location barcode. If disabled, the picking's default source location is used"
" automatically."
msgstr ""
"若启用，条码扫描流程要求操作员扫描源库位条码。"
"若禁用，则自动使用调拨单的默认源库位。"

